    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I checked the CRC errors and I'm not seeing much there, which is weird. It just feels like there's some kind of phantom interference or something causing these random drops. It's almost like there's some kind of gremlin in the hardware or some hidden glitch that won't show up in the standard logs. \n\nAny other ideas on what could be causing such erratic, unlogged behavior?",
